    "      \"In iteration 3. the difference was 46.68315006648863 \\n\",\n",
    "      \"In iteration 5. the difference was 73.9450847346027 \\n\",\n",
    "      \"In iteration 7. the difference was 99.65450824849131 \\n\",\n",
